OL,3,GNEWSATrams set to resume after two
OL,4,Aweeks of major disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FTram services are due to return to
OL,7,Fnormal on Greater Manchester's
OL,8,FMetrolink network on Monday after two
OL,9,Fweeks of major disruption.
OL,11,FImprovement works have taken place at
OL,12,FDeansgate-Castlefield and Trafford Bar,
OL,13,Fas well as in Manchester city centre,
OL,14,Fmeaning no services ran on three
OL,15,FMetrolink lines over that time.
OL,17,FA spokesman for Transport for Greater
OL,18,FManchester (TfGM) confirmed the work
OL,19,Fwas on schedule to have been completed.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
