OL,3,GNEWSATrams set to resume after two
OL,4,Aweeks of major disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, passengers have been warned
OL,7,Fthat some minor route changes through
OL,8,Fthe city centre will remain in place
OL,9,Funtil Wednesday, with travellers
OL,10,Fadvised to check the TfGM website.
